2378..2452 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2453..2527 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2528..2606 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2607..2678 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2679..2754 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2755..2835 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2836..2912 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2913..2995 Comment "/// compose to `Path.ap(loopOn, Path.ap(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
2996..3068 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3069..3087 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
